# rc3 (2026-10-27): as rc2 but with the README's fixed APS5_RESOURCE_CACHE_ENTRIES=1024 again (rc2 with the adaptive
# cache ran 13.9-14.5 presents per 10 s from the start, against 18.4-19.3 in el16/dp1). Tests the new runtime switch
# APS5_STORING_TEMPLATES (draws that store through BDA as one-use templates) with and without deferred stores.
measure 60
base-1 75
st-1 75 switch APS5_STORING_TEMPLATES on
ds-1 75 deferstores on
dsst-1 75 deferstores on;;switch APS5_STORING_TEMPLATES on
base-2 75
st-2 75 switch APS5_STORING_TEMPLATES on
ds-2 75 deferstores on
dsst-2 75 deferstores on;;switch APS5_STORING_TEMPLATES on
